{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25616846",
      "title": "Working with Params for SSG Data Fetching",
      "sourceHash": "54d84596ee81131d9ae4edc9c3c76aef7fd438dc4aedc4d268edf894de13ae2a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.666,
          "end": 3.82,
          "en": "Now that was a lot of talking",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.82,
          "end": 5.953,
          "en": "about getStaticProps and getServerSideProps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.08,
          "end": 9.717,
          "en": "But these are two key concepts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.717,
          "end": 13.85,
          "en": "two key functions built into next JS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.85,
          "end": 15.72,
          "en": "which you need all the time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.72,
          "end": 18.48,
          "en": "As you'll see in my full course, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.48,
          "end": 20.9,
          "en": "when we work on that full block project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.9,
          "end": 23.97,
          "en": "we use those functions everywhere.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.97,
          "end": 25.943,
          "en": "They are super important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.8,
          "end": 27.977,
          "en": "And hence, let's also use them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.977,
          "end": 30.4,
          "en": "for the MeetupDetail page now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.4,
          "end": 33.46,
          "en": "For the new Meetup page, as explained earlier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.46,
          "end": 36.83,
          "en": "we don't need them because here we don't need any data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.83,
          "end": 39.472,
          "en": "and therefore there is no need to add getStaticProps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.472,
          "end": 42.36,
          "en": "It's really only there to fetch data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.36,
          "end": 43.888,
          "en": "for the pre-generated page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.888,
          "end": 46.47,
          "en": "if that page needs any data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.47,
          "end": 48.43,
          "en": "and therefore we don't need it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.43,
          "end": 50.36,
          "en": "but on the MeetupDetail page of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.36,
          "end": 52.734,
          "en": "We do have data that is needed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 52.734,
          "end": 56.9,
          "en": "for the moment hard-coded data, but that will change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.9,
          "end": 58.885,
          "en": "And hence, here on MeetupDetails,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 58.885,
          "end": 63.885,
          "en": "we also want to use getStaticProps or getServerSideProps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.94,
          "end": 66.69,
          "en": "Now, which one is better?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.69,
          "end": 68.985,
          "en": "It depends on how often your data changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.985,
          "end": 72.17,
          "en": "and if you need access to the request object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.17,
          "end": 74.45,
          "en": "And here it's probably fair to assume",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.45,
          "end": 78.02,
          "en": "that the meetupData does not change very often.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.02,
          "end": 80.605,
          "en": "Indeed this app doesn't even have a feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 80.605,
          "end": 83.23,
          "en": "for changing the meetupData.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 83.23,
          "end": 84.655,
          "en": "We can only add Meetups",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 84.655,
          "end": 88.31,
          "en": "but even if it would have a change feature,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 88.31,
          "end": 90.351,
          "en": "it would probably not be the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 90.351,
          "end": 94.33,
          "en": "that a Meetup changes multiple times every second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 94.33,
          "end": 96.09,
          "en": "And therefore, for to MeetupDetails",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 96.09,
          "end": 97.82,
          "en": "I would argue that again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 97.82,
          "end": 101.43299999999999,
          "en": "getStaticProps is better than getServerSideProps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 103.096,
          "end": 106.08,
          "en": "So here we export getStaticProps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 106.08,
          "end": 108.41,
          "en": "and we can turn it into an async function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 108.41,
          "end": 110.77000000000001,
          "en": "if we want to use async await.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 110.77000000000001,
          "end": 115.77000000000001,
          "en": "And then here we could fetch the data for a single meetup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 116.35,
          "end": 120.15,
          "en": "And then we can of course return as object with the props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 120.15,
          "end": 123.057,
          "en": "And here we could have our meetupData prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 123.057,
          "end": 124.999,
          "en": "or however you want to name it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 124.999,
          "end": 127.804,
          "en": "which could again be a nested object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 127.804,
          "end": 131.1,
          "en": "where we then have this data here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 131.1,
          "end": 133.55,
          "en": "so where we have that image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 133.55,
          "end": 136.758,
          "en": "So we have image set to the string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 136.758,
          "end": 141.17000000000002,
          "en": "where we have ID if we needed, M1.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 141.17000000000002,
          "end": 142.863,
          "en": "Where we have the title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 143.906,
          "end": 145.753,
          "en": "First Meetup here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 148.48,
          "end": 153.48,
          "en": "Where we have the address and that's this address",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 153.69,
          "end": 158.69,
          "en": "and where we then also have the description here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 158.69,
          "end": 160.47,
          "en": "this description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 160.47,
          "end": 162.13,
          "en": "That could be the props data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 162.13,
          "end": 165.566,
          "en": "which we send to this component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 165.566,
          "end": 170.566,
          "en": "But here we'll actually have a slight problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 170.57999999999998,
          "end": 173.81,
          "en": "Keep in mind that this is a dynamic page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 173.81,
          "end": 177.48,
          "en": "So when we reach out to an API to fetch the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 177.48,
          "end": 178.775,
          "en": "for a single meetup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 178.775,
          "end": 182.64,
          "en": "we need a way of identifying that meetup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 182.64,
          "end": 185.23,
          "en": "We need its ID for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 185.23,
          "end": 190.23,
          "en": "Now the ID thankfully is encoded into URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 190.74,
          "end": 192.25,
          "en": "And therefore, we did learn",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 192.25,
          "end": 196.2,
          "en": "that we can use stead use router hook to get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 196.2,
          "end": 200.7,
          "en": "to this router object and then use the query property there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 200.7,
          "end": 204.136,
          "en": "That's what we did earlier in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.136,
          "end": 206.38,
          "en": "But the problem with that is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 206.38,
          "end": 209.07,
          "en": "that the use router hook can only be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 209.07,
          "end": 212.113,
          "en": "in the component function, not in geStaticProps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 213.02,
          "end": 217.18,
          "en": "That's not a function where you can use react hooks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 217.18,
          "end": 219.2,
          "en": "So we can't get to the meetup ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 219.2,
          "end": 223.025,
          "en": "from the URL with help of use router in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 223.025,
          "end": 225.36,
          "en": "But we also don't need to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 225.36,
          "end": 228.07,
          "en": "Because you might remember this context parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228.07,
          "end": 229.59,
          "en": "which I mentioned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 229.59,
          "end": 233.29,
          "en": "I showed it to you on getServerSideProps,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 233.29,
          "end": 235.66,
          "en": "but I mentioned that it also actually exists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 235.66,
          "end": 237.183,
          "en": "on getStaticProps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 238.52,
          "end": 241.65,
          "en": "Now, when we accept it on getStaticProps,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 241.65,
          "end": 244.88,
          "en": "context will not hold request and response,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 244.88,
          "end": 249.7,
          "en": "but it will, for example, have a parans key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 249.7,
          "end": 252.33,
          "en": "So there will be context.parans,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 252.33,
          "end": 256.228,
          "en": "and that will be an object where our identifiers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 256.228,
          "end": 259.652,
          "en": "between the square brackets will be properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 259.652,
          "end": 262.84,
          "en": "and the values will be the actual values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 262.84,
          "end": 264.923,
          "en": "encoded in the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 265.86,
          "end": 269.23,
          "en": "So our meetup ID, for example, could be accessed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 269.23,
          "end": 271.363,
          "en": "with context.parans.meetupid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 272.82,
          "end": 275.76800000000003,
          "en": "Meetup ID because that's the identifier I have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 275.76800000000003,
          "end": 277.374,
          "en": "between the square brackets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 277.374,
          "end": 280.481,
          "en": "And that would then be the concrete meetup ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 280.481,
          "end": 282.923,
          "en": "for which we're displaying this meetup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 283.96,
          "end": 288.29,
          "en": "I can console log this here inside of getStaticProps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 288.29,
          "end": 291.303,
          "en": "so that we can see that this really works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 291.303,
          "end": 295.249,
          "en": "And then it's this meetup ID, which we could set as ID here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 295.249,
          "end": 298.493,
          "en": "if we want to expose it to the component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 299.61,
          "end": 301.65,
          "en": "With that if we saved this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 301.65,
          "end": 305.598,
          "en": "and visit the detailed page of a single meetup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 305.598,
          "end": 310.248,
          "en": "we get an error though, getStaticProps is required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 310.248,
          "end": 312.413,
          "en": "Now, what's this error about?",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}